<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\電車ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\豊岳駅ホーム.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>―The train arrived at <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="とよたけ">Toyotake</STYLE> Station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One last transfer. The next train would take me to Arata Station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From there, a walk of about 2 hours along a mountain road would bring me to the Arata settlement.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\豊岳駅外.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I decided to spend the 20 minutes until the next train on a bench outside the station.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "281" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "600" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\豊岳.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Beautiful cherry blossoms were dancing in the air.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Live in this Japan of ours, and there are cherry blossoms everywhere you look.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It must be a hard season for people with cherry-blossom allergies.<PG>
Cherry-blossom allergies...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to think of it, I remember <STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE> saying something like this in a conversation with our mother.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Erina's senpai</STYLE> hated cherry blossoms.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently, whenever cherry blossom season came, she would fall ill and spend days in bed.<PG>
I've looked into that as well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Though half of it is guesswork...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="2">Erina's</STYLE> senpai.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As a little girl, <STYLE ID="3">she</STYLE> had been drenched in the blood of <STYLE ID="4">Eiichiro Niimura</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At some point, <STYLE ID="4">he</STYLE> must have used a drug called Droga, which that Arata settlement had created.<PG>
Those who have used this Droga are called the first generation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The term was apparently used by some cult when it carried out repeated human experiments.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even after Droga wears off, its components remain in the body.<PG>
If the mucous membranes of the head（eyeballs, lips and so on）come into contact with first-generation blood, the circumstances of touching that blood are re-created, and this brings on illness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
People with this constitution are apparently called the second generation.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\血しぶき背景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供血.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
But in exchange, they are said to have danger sense.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi Kogori</STYLE> apparently had a similar ability as well.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\壺点火.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Droga is made from the roots of cherry trees that grow wild in the Arata district.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The cherry trees of the Arata settlement had produced that devil's drug, Droga.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I understand the urge to admire cherry blossoms, but to me now they're nothing but a hateful plant.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If only there were no cherry trees, <STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE> might not have had to die...<PG>
The Arata cherry―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I go to the Arata settlement, will I end up seeing it with my own eyes too?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Droga's effects are said to be beyond imagination.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It supposedly lets you run 100 meters in 3-something seconds, leap 3 meters, and even dodge bullets.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the people of Arata used Droga and came at me, my <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ふくしゅう">revenge</STYLE> play would end as a failed attempt.<PG>
I see, so this is what the Megasawa City case really was.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So if you take the limiter off your muscle strength, it isn't impossible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, why did the state keep the truth of this Megasawa City case hidden?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something like this, you'd think anyone could figure out with a little digging.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could it be that they deliberately―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\豊岳駅外.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Hang in there, Mama! We're almost at the bench!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As I sat lost in thought, a girl's voice reached my ears.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There were two people who looked like a parent and child.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One was a girl of about middle-school age, and the other was probably her mother.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But both of them looked a little unusual.<PG>
Their hair was tinged with brown, and their eyes were blue.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, green?<PG>
Then, 
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
the arm that had been around the girl's shoulders slid away, and the woman who seemed to be the mother collapsed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mama! Stay with me!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without thinking, I ran over to the fallen woman.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It can't hurt to do a good deed this small, here at the very end.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Let's get her to the bench."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Y-yes!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The girl and I held up her mother and sat her down on the bench.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"S-sorry..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The mother <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="わ">apologized</STYLE> in a feeble voice.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\昼の月.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I saw her face up close.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Two blue eyes that called to mind a clear sky and a beautiful sea.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her features, too, were a little different from a Japanese person's. Was she a foreigner after all?<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Thank you for your kindness."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the moment our eyes first met.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I felt as if I'd been flung into another dimension.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Eyes as clear as a celestial maiden's, and <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="たお">graceful</STYLE> movements.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And a gentle way of speaking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could hardly believe she was a woman, the same as me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I had to compare her to something―
{PAUSE ""}
a goddess.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Uh, thank you very much!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">The girl</STYLE> thanked me as she wiped the sweat from <STYLE ID="8">her mother's</STYLE> forehead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">This girl</STYLE> had odd eyes, one blue and one green.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When she grew up, would she become a beautiful woman like <STYLE ID="8">her mother</STYLE>?<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Uh... if you'd like, shall I go with you as far as your house?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　I'm just drifting around these parts on a solo trip, so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It would only be a follow-up to my small good deed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If they were here, they were probably taking the same train.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Oh, but if they're going the opposite way, that'd be a pain...<PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"No, the station we're getting off at, Arata Station, is far, so..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Arata Station was where I planned to get off too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then it wouldn't be out of my way.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"I'm getting off at Arata Station too. It's fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Huh...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> have business in the Arata settlement... with us?"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
Could these people be from Arata...!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is Arata Station used only by people from the Arata settlement?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With almost no savings left by the time of the <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ふくしゅう">revenge</STYLE>, I hadn't been able to afford to scout this area.<PG>
<STYLE ID="10">"Uh, is something wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had frozen for a while, and <STYLE ID="10">the girl</STYLE> spoke to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh? No, it's nothing..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It felt as if the tumor called conscience had grown even larger.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Should I shoot this mother and daughter dead right here, before it grew any bigger?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I unzipped my bag and touched the gun.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I stopped myself right away.<PG>
Because if I did something like that, there would be an uproar, and the trains would probably stop running.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was the only reason.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was the only reason―so I told myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes, because I'm a selfish person.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "148" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\豊岳駅ホーム.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I waited for the train together with the mother and daughter.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The mother's name was <STYLE ID="8">Sakura Niimura</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The daughter's name was <STYLE ID="10">Kana</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Niimura was the same surname as that of someone <STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE> was often with, her <STYLE ID="11">senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since they were from the same settlement, it was no wonder they shared a surname.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, would you like to come to our house?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　If you are traveling alone and have not decided where to stay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Ha! That's a great idea! </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, please come!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">　There are lots of rare, delicious things in Arata!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Mama's</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> cooking is really delicious!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't answer the invitation right away.<PG>
If they put me up, I might be able to <STYLE ID="12" RUBY="せんめつ">wipe out</STYLE> the residents in one go.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That would be more efficient.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But my biggest worry is―the growth of the <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="りょうしん">tumor</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="りょうしん">tumor</STYLE> keeps growing, slowly and surely.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Kindness is a nasty additive that makes the <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="りょうしん">tumor</STYLE> grow.<PG>
I really hadn't expected people from Arata to show me kindness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seems my <STYLE ID="13" RUBY="りょうしん">tumor</STYLE> is malignant.<PG>
But I won't lose.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm not about to be swayed by kindness or sympathy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll strike down <STYLE ID="2">my sister's</STYLE> <STYLE ID="14" RUBY="かたき">enemy</STYLE>. That one conviction, I have no intention of bending.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All right, I'll go along with this mother and daughter.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\電車進行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\電車昼.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Before long the train arrived, and we boarded a train with no one else on it.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE> lay down on the side-facing bench seat as soon as she got on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She really did seem quite unwell.<PG>
When is the best time to kill this mother and daughter?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Should I kill them as soon as we get off the train?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This far out in the country, there probably won't be anyone at the station either.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
